idle-savers (3.3.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * All 11 savers' `tick` benches are now gated against a real baseline
  * (66 entries read from criterion's estimates.json), replacing a
  * perf.yml that ran 4 savers, swallowed every failure with `|| true`,
  * and compared nothing.
  * `scripts/check-perf-labels.sh` fails CI on a false T1 claim.
  * Fixes: `cargo bench -p bursts --bench tick` panicked on every grid
  * because prepare_for_bench pre-stamped the size that resize_if_needed
  * uses as its init guard, leaving skyline empty.

 -- IdleScreen Maintainers <maintainers@idlescreen.dev>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:02:57 -0000

